****************
CS:APP Proxy Lab
****************

Makefile	- For building proxy
README		- This file

# Proxy source files
proxy.{c,h}	- Primary proxy code
csapp.{c,h}	- Wrapper and helper functions from the CS:APP text

1. Run Makefile: make
2. Run the proxy in PROCESS MODE: ./proxy <port>
3. Run the proxy in THREAD MODE: ./proxy <port>
4. In new terminal run: curl -x localhost:15213 http://example.com
5. To test HTTP Tunneling, run curl -x localhost:15213 https://www.google.com -k
6. TO test Persistant Connections, run: curl -x localhost:15213 http://example.com --header "Connection: keep-alive"


